Time of service that is being documented

When used for searching for CCD documents (type=http://loinc.org|34133-9 OR type=34133-9), a subset of the FHIR specification is allowed:

1. period={qualifier}{date}
Qualifier: gt (greater than), lt (less than), ge (greater than or equal to), le (less than or equal to)
2. period={date}
Inferred qualifier of eq (equals)
3. period={qualifier}{date}&period={qualifier}{date}
Qualifier: one gt and one lt
Date formats: yyyy-MM-dd

